,{
"ClauseCode":"1017804"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">If the aggregate claim for any one loss does not exceed the specific amount entered in the Schedule or fifteen percent (15) of the sum insured by the item or items affected no special inventory or appraisement of the undamaged property shall be required. For the purpose of this clause, the tem &ldquo;item&rdquo; shall be held to apply to the total sum insured.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Appraisement Clause (15% of Total Sum Insured)"
