,"ClauseContent":"<p><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">This insurance includes cover for computer system records but only for the&nbsp;value of the materials together with the cost of clerical labour and computer&nbsp; time expended in reproducing such records (excluding any expenses in&nbsp;connection with the production of information to be recorded therein) and not&nbsp;for the value to the Insured of the information contained therein.</span></span></p>"
