,{
"ClauseCode":"1009654"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">The insurance by this policy extends to cover cost of re-erecting, fitting and fixing machinery or plant destroyed or damaged by fire or by any other peril hereby insured against provided always that the liability of the company shall not exceed the sum insured of such machinery or plant under this policy</span></span></p>"
