,"pxCreateOpName":"DIDIK SAPUTRA"
,"pxCreateSystemID":"pegaprodasm83"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"SearchClause":"ire Ext"
,"Section":"1"
}
,{
"ClauseCode":"1003789"
,"ClauseContent":"<p><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Certain of the Property insured may be the subject of hire purchase lease or other agreements and the interest of the other parties to these arrangements is noted in this insurance, the nature and extent of such interest to be disclosed by the Insured in the event of damage.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"General Interest Clause"
,"ClauseTitle":"General Interest Clause"
,"IsHeaderClause":"false"
,"KodeSection":"1"
,"pxCreateDateTime":"20251224T033923.403 GMT"
,"pxCreateOperator":"DIDIKSAPUTRA_1"
,"pxCreateOpName":"DIDIK SAPUTRA"
,"pxCreateSystemID":"pegaprodasm83"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"SearchClause":"General Interest Clause"
,"Section":"1"
}
,{
"ClauseCode":"1004528"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">It is hereby declared and agreed that property damage covered under this policy shall mean physical damage to the substance of the items insured.&quot;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">Physical damage to the item(s) insured shall not include loss of or damage:</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">a.&nbsp;To data or software, e.g. any detrimental change in data, software or computer programs caused by a deletion, corruption or deformation of the original structure. Notwithstanding this, however, loss of or damage to data or software which is the direct consequence of insured physical damage to the substance of the item(s) insured shall be covered.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">b. Resulting from an impairment in the function, availability, range of use or accessibility of data, software or computer programs of the item(s) insured.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">Consequently, any business interruption losses resulting from the above, shall not be covered by this policy.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Property Damage Clarification Clause"
,"ClauseTitle":"Property Damage Clarification Clause"
,"IsHeaderClause":"false"
,"KodeSection":"4"
,"pxCreateDateTime":"20251224T033928.760 GMT"
,"pxCreateOperator":"DIDIKSAPUTRA_1"
,"pxCreateOpName":"DIDIK SAPUTRA"
,"pxCreateSystemID":"pegaprodasm83"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"SearchClause":"roperty Dam"
,"Section":"4"
}
,{
"ClauseCode":"1018316"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">This Policy insures costs and expenses necessarily and reasonably incurred in respect of:<br />\na) The removal storage and/or disposal of debris or the demolition dismantling shoring up propping underpinning or other temporary repairs consequent upon damage to the Property Insured by this Policy;<br />\nb) The Insured&rsquo;s legal liability in respect of removal storage and/or disposal of debris provided that such liability was not assumed by the Insured under an agreement entered into after the commencement of the Period of Insurance or any renewal thereof unless liability would have attached in the absence of such agreement. Provided that the insurance under this extension does not extend to any liability that the Insured may incur as a consequence of pollution of any kind;<br />\nc) The demolition and removal of any property belonging to the Insured which is no longer useful for the purpose it was intended providing such demolition and removal is necessary for the purpose of the reinstatement or replacement of Property Insured under this extension and is consequent upon damage to the Property Insured.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Removal of Debris Clause (10% of Claim)"
,"ClauseTitle":"Removal of Debris Clause (10% of Claim)"
,"IsHeaderClause":"false"
,"KodeSection":"1"
,"pxCreateDateTime":"20251224T033936.049 GMT"
,"pxCreateOperator":"DIDIKSAPUTRA_1"
,"pxCreateOpName":"DIDIK SAPUTRA"
,"pxCreateSystemID":"pegaprodasm83"
,"pxObjClass":"ASM-FW-GISFW-Data-Clause"
,"SearchClause":"oval of D"
,"Section":"1"
}
,{
"ClauseCode":"1017824"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">It is understood and agreed that otherwise subject to the terms, exclusion, provision and conditions contained in the Policy or endorsed thereon, where an insure items totally destroyed or damaged, the basis upon which the amount payable under the policy is to be calculated shall be the full replacement value of the item destroyed or damage.&nbsp;<br />\n&ldquo;Replacement Value&rdquo; shall mean the cost, which would have to be incurred immediately before&nbsp;destruction of or damage to an insured item for replacing the destroyed or damaged item by a new item of similar kind, capacity, size and quality.</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Replacement Value Clause"
,"ClauseTitle":"Replacement Value Clause [BINDER KBRU 2024]"
,"IsHeaderClause":"false"
