,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">1.Insurers shall under this section, subject to the terms and conditions of the&nbsp;policy, indemnity the insured on the basis of the full cost of repairing,&nbsp;<br />\nreinstating or replacing property lost or damage even though such cost may vary from the original construction costs including value added tax&nbsp; (PPN)<br />\n2. It is agreed that all monies property due to in settlement of claims under&nbsp;this section of policy shall be paid to or their order</span></span></p>"
