,{
"ClauseCode":"1018321"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">The insurance under this Clause is to cover reasonable expenses reasonably incurred by the Insured and not otherwise recoverable, for preparation, proving and/or verification of claims made by the Insured under this Policy. For the purpose of this Clause such reasonable expenses shall include but not limited to fees for financial advisors, accountants, business interruption claim advocates and preparers and values appointed by the insured and such other reasonable expenses shall be deemed to include salaries, wages and overheads of the Insured&rsquo;s employees. Liability of the Insurer under this Clause is limited to 2.5% of Total Sum Insured</span></span></p>"
,"ClauseDescription":"Cost of Re-writing Records and Claim Preparation Clause (2.5% of TSI)"
