,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">In the event of any conflict of interpretation between the various clauses and&nbsp;conditions contained in this Policy, the broadest and least restrictive wording to the benefit of the Insured shall always prevail.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:9px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\">Notwithstanding the above,&nbsp;this insurance shall not be affected by the failure of the Insured to comply with&nbsp;laws, statutes or jurisdiction which would otherwise have been a bar to any&nbsp;claim in respect of loss, destruction or damage.</span></span></p>"
