,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;\">In the event of any reasonable expenses being incurred by the Insured in their efforts to recover safeguard or preserve the Property Insured to minimize any loss as insured by Sections One and Two of the Policy or to prosecute in its own name to any claim for indemnity or damages or otherwise against any persons in respect of such loss the Insurer shall pay such expenses</span></span></p>"
