,{
"ClauseCode":"1017260"
,"ClauseContent":"<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This Contract excludes liability arising from bodily injury which arises from asbestosis or any asbestos-related disease or property damage directly or indirectly resulting from the existence, handling, processing, manufacture, sale, distribution, storage or use of asbestos, asbestos products and/or products containing asbestos. This exclusion does not apply to bodily injury due to products containing asbestos where the cause of the bodily injury is unrelated to the presence of asbestos.</p>"
